.TH STTY 1 "FUZIX" "Ripple"
.SH NAME
stty \- inspect or change terminal settings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
stty [options]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
With no options, show terminal settings. -a displays all settings; -g
prints the encoded form that can be supplied to restore them.
.PP
Common options include echo, -echo, icanon, -icanon, isig, -isig, raw and
cooked. Only the flags supported by the console driver affect its behavior.
An invalid option fails without applying a partial change.
